 "definition": "Autodesk software that combines design and construction models of a building project so they can be reviewed and checked for clashes.",
 "description": {
  "text": "A 3D design review package for Windows, previously called JetStream, used mainly in architecture, engineering and construction. It combines 3D models from other design tools, lets users navigate and review them with comments, redlining and measurements, and has plug-ins for interference detection and 4D simulation.",
